#ASSERT `s 78J the director is guilty of an offence` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78J the director is guilty of an offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78J the director is guilty of an offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 78J a director must not make a false statement which the director does not believe to be true` (Director "A Director") AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "A Director" DOES `s 78J make a statement under section 78E(1)(d)(ii), (2)(c), (3)(e)(i) or (4)(e)(i) which is false and which the director does not believe to be true` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 78J a director must not make a false statement which the director does not believe to be true` (Director "A Director") AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 60)

-- ===== s 78K =====
-- A member is not liable to a call greater than the issue price less (the amount paid up plus the amount reduced), if any: issue price 10, paid up 6, reduced 3 -> 1.
#ASSERT `s 78K the greatest call or contribution a member is liable to in respect of the issue price of the share` TRUE 10 6 3 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 78K the greatest call or contribution a member is liable to in respect of the issue price of the share` TRUE 10 6 4 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `s 78K the greatest call or contribution a member is liable to in respect of the issue price of the share` TRUE 10 6 5 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `s 78K the greatest call or contribution a member is liable to in respect of the issue price of the share` TRUE 10 0 0 EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `s 78K the greatest call or contribution a member is liable to in respect of the issue price of the share` FALSE 10 6 3 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78K the member is liable to the call or contribution` TRUE 10 6 3 1.5 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78K the member is liable to the call or contribution` TRUE 10 6 3 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78K the member is liable to the call or contribution` TRUE 10 6 3 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 78K the member is liable to the call or contribution` TRUE 10 6 4 0.5 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 78K the member is liable to the call or contribution` FALSE 10 6 3 1.5 EQUALS NOTHING
